//===- CheckedAArch64Instructions.def - Admitted ARMv8 checked ISA --------===//
//
// NeverD Decompiler
//
//===----------------------------------------------------------------------===//
// The baseline register subsets exclude SVE/SME, optional ISA extensions,
// half-precision FP and constrained-unpredictable writeback. System access
// admits only the exact flags, thread-pointer and FP control/status encodings
// below. FP arithmetic requires masked exceptions and baseline rounding/FZ/DN
// control.
